{"summary":"Create your royal story and become the most famous balls manager!","description":"⭐Idle Royal Stories: A Regency Era Adventure Awaits!⭐\n\nStep into the enchanting world of 'Idle Royal Stories', an incremental idle game set in the captivating Regency era. Manage grand parties and climb the social ladder in this unique strategy game that combines historical charm with addictive gameplay.\n\nExperience the Splendor of Regency Era:\n'Idle Royal Stories' invites you to run the most splendid parties. Select distinguished visitors, each bestowing unique bonuses, to enhance your gala. Whether it's increasing income from a specific service or unlocking new, exciting features, every choice shapes your journey.\n\nUnique Features:\n\n⭐Select Visitors: Choose from a variety of visitors, each with unique bonuses.\n⭐Incremental Progression: Grow your party from a simple gathering to a grand ball.\n⭐Unlock Services: With each successful party, unlock new services and expand your estate.\n⭐Historical Setting: Immerse yourself in the beautifully crafted Regency era environment.\n⭐Easy to Play, Challenging to Master:\nBegin your journey with ease and discover the depth of strategy as you progress. No prior knowledge of idle games is needed – just a keen sense of strategy and a love for regal stories.\n\nIGRS rating: 13+","esrbNotes":"Violence","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":"$0.99 - $104.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MU6sfuM7Gbg?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7Nao4GdPjKeJG-GMW0cPG6V6EBGpvHYoiHHF95ByNYQKdtdjENwfvmj6lr0TC0Kqg5eS0JnfW56cKU_0j_PH0ic","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sWG_y227NG_zIS0Dd3WRXxjG4ozNqOVDejolAuy0r47oYYfOZryGuHhasJdd6Pz2DaAWdlZFvw-pDcuHBPHb","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wP33MtKwzDQEdh7q9E8K-5c1wdZAGdgu3fW1Vd07n3ZBJznL-FkbxijD8oy8R8wz-aNWZQs27AnyqDPleJyzEQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yp3V6Ce6_hC9Iz5jPKXzOTFUO6nQXU0bjxhP